  * On a phone the list showed two "+ New note" buttons (the action row's and
    the list head's); the list head's now hides there.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:05:00 -0600

homelab-notes (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First release (post-cutover #71): notes.<domain>. Notebooks, folders and
    notes in Markdown, HTML or plain text, rendered by the package's own
    Markdown subset and cleaned by an allowlist sanitiser on Mojo::DOM (no
    inline script can run: the pages carry a CSP without inline script).
    Versions (the last 20 bodies, restorable), links on a note to an email
    (picked by searching the viewer's mail through the gateway) or a drive
    file (picked by browsing their drive), sharing to accounts (read or edit)
    or by link, full-text search, a trash. The same handlers behind a Bearer
    check under /internal/v1/notes/* for homelab-cli through homelab-api.
    /metrics for Prometheus.

 -- Jeff Gardner <mailmasker-api01@forge.name>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:40:00 -0600
